sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as modelmesh-controller<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant etcd as etcd Cluster<br/>2379/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant MMSidecar as ModelMesh Sidecar<br/>gRPC TLS
    participant Adapter as Runtime Adapter<br/>localhost gRPC
    participant Storage as Object Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Runtime as Inference Runtime<br/>localhost gRPC
    participant RestProxy as REST Proxy<br/>8008/TCP HTTP
    participant Client as Inference Client

    Note over User,Storage: Flow 1: Model Deployment
    User->>K8sAPI: Create Predictor CR<br/>HTTPS / Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (Predictor)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA Token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>HTTPS / SA Token
    Controller->>etcd: Register model metadata<br/>gRPC TLS / Client cert
    etcd-->>MMSidecar: Model placement event<br/>gRPC TLS / Client cert
    MMSidecar->>Adapter: Load model<br/>gRPC (loopback)
    Adapter->>Storage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS / Storage credentials
    Storage-->>Adapter: Model artifacts
    Adapter-->>MMSidecar: Model loaded
    MMSidecar-->>etcd: Update model status<br/>gRPC TLS

    Note over Client,Runtime: Flow 2: Inference Request (gRPC)
    Client->>MMSidecar: gRPC inference request<br/>TLS (optional, from Secret)
    MMSidecar->>Runtime: Forward to runtime<br/>gRPC (loopback)
    Runtime-->>MMSidecar: Prediction result
    MMSidecar-->>Client: gRPC response

    Note over Client,Runtime: Flow 3: Inference Request (REST)
    Client->>RestProxy: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>HTTP 8008
    RestProxy->>MMSidecar: Translate to gRPC
    MMSidecar->>Runtime: Forward to runtime<br/>gRPC (loopback)
    Runtime-->>MMSidecar: Prediction result
    MMSidecar-->>RestProxy: gRPC response
    RestProxy-->>Client: JSON response
